OL,3,GNEWSADelayed 'much-needed' social homes
OL,4,Adue by Christmas                       
OL,6,FAlmost two years later than expected, a
OL,7,Fsocial housing project will welcome    
OL,8,Fresidents in time for Christmas,       
OL,9,Faccording to developers.               
OL,11,FHomes in Somerset, which manages social
OL,12,Fhousing on behalf of Somerset Council, 
OL,13,Fhas been working with contractor       
OL,14,FClassic Builders to deliver 33 new one 
OL,15,Fand two-bedroom flats on the Penlea    
OL,16,FHouse site in Bridgwater.              
OL,18,FThe first residents were due to move in
OL,19,FJanuary 2025 but the project has faced 
OL,20,Fa number of delays, including a        
OL,21,Fbreak-in in February.                  
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
